# Nafs Asp is blocked by Bot2's Ornithopter and deals its damage to the creature, not to a player (CR 603.2, 120.2):
# nothing triggers, so Bot2, with a Mox untapped, is offered no payment, and loses nothing at their draw step.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Nafs Asp
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Nafs Asp.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Nafs Asp)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Nafs Asp)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
! Bot2.Nafs Asp.Activate
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
